'''''Prunella grandiflora''''', the '''large-flowered selfheal''',<ref name=BSBI07>{{BSBI 2007 |access-date=2014-10-17 }}</ref> is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Lamiaceae]]. It is native to Europe and neighboring parts of West Asia.<ref>{{cite web |title=Prunella grandiflora |url=http://www.floraiberica.es/floraiberica/texto/pdfs/12_140_30_Prunella.pdf |publisher=[[Flora Iberica]] |access-date=29 June 2022}}</ref>

